<!-- World Almanac: the "Balance of Power" dashboard. The leather art + all the frames, labels, medallions,
     nav bar and tagline live in the background image (cr_BalanceOfPower.jpg, 3312x1900); this prefab overlays
     ONLY the data into those regions. A prefab edit shows via cr.reload_ui (panel open) or a build + restart.
     Bound to BalanceOfPowerViewModel. The three podium cards are now INDEPENDENT widgets (bound to First /
     Second / Third), each placed absolutely over its own painted frame: tune each card's MarginLeft (and the
     shared MarginTop) on its own, since a single ListPanel could not align three cards to three fixed frames. -->
